mp; Achievements.<br>• Unlock and listen to our soundtrack whenever you want!<br>• Collect secret artworks and bonus scenes in our Art Gallery.<br>Each artwork and background of our Visual Novel is available in 4k ULTRA HD resolution, which offers clearer and more detailed images even at lower resolutions.",
